#. Translators: Summary/title for this add-on
msgid "Laprdus TTS"
msgstr "Laprdus TTS"

#. Translators: Long description to be shown for this add-on
msgid ""
"Text-to-speech synthesizer for NVDA.\n"
"Laprdus speaks Croatian, Serbian, Bosnian and Slovenian with every one of its voices: the rule-based voices Zvonko (the default), Stojan and Mirsad,\n"
"the recorded voices Josip and Vlado, the presets Detence, Baba and Đedo, and the ten singing voices Orguljaš, Dalmacija Klapa,\n"
"Trubač, Harmonikaš, Sevdalija, Sazlija, Lika Velebit, Solunac, Sarajevo Bembaša and Bećarac.\n"
"The language is a separate setting, with word stress and natural sentence melody in every voice."
msgstr ""
"Sintetizator govora za NVDA.\n"
"Laprdus svakim svojim glasom govori hrvatski, srpski, bosanski i slovenski: glasovi sintetizirani pravilima Zvonko (zadani), Stojan i Mirsad,\n"
"snimljeni glasovi Josip i Vlado, predlošci Detence, Baba i Đedo te deset pjevajućih glasova Orguljaš, Dalmacija Klapa,\n"
"Trubač, Harmonikaš, Sevdalija, Sazlija, Lika Velebit, Solunac, Sarajevo Bembaša i Bećarac.\n"
"Jezik je zasebna postavka, a svi glasovi imaju naglasak riječi i prirodnu rečeničnu melodiju."

#. Translators: what's new content for the add-on version
msgid ""
"Laprdus 2.0 for NVDA.\n"
"- Every voice speaks every language: Croatian, Serbian, Bosnian and Slovenian are a separate Language setting before the voice (NVDA's automatic language switching switches among them); Zvonko is the default voice\n"
"- Three new voices synthesized by rule, clear at any rate: Zvonko, Stojan and Mirsad; Bosnian and Slovenian are now supported\n"
"- Word stress and natural sentence melody for every voice; Josip and Vlado have a new engine without clicks, with a natural tempo and rate and pitch that no longer affect each other\n"
"- Ten singing voices: Orguljaš, Dalmacija Klapa, Trubač, Harmonikaš, Sevdalija, Sazlija, Lika Velebit, Solunac, Sarajevo Bembaša and Bećarac\n"
"- NVDA's Inflection slider controls the sentence melody of every voice, and an accent dictionary (accents.json) to correct the stress of a word\n"
"- Letters are spelled by their sounds (b, c, d) unless the Configurator says names; capital letters are spelled at NVDA's capital pitch change, as with NVDA's other synthesizers\n"
"- The add-on and the Laprdus Configurator are available in English, Croatian, Serbian and Slovenian: both follow NVDA's language\n"
"- Fixed: user spelling and emoji dictionary entries had no effect\n"
msgstr ""
"Laprdus 2.0 za NVDA.\n"
"- Svaki glas govori svim jezicima: jezik (hrvatski, srpski, bosanski ili slovenski) zasebna je postavka ispred glasa (NVDA-ovo automatsko mijenjanje jezika prebacuje među njima); Zvonko je zadani glas\n"
"- Tri nova glasa sintetizirana pravilima, razgovijetna pri svakoj brzini: Zvonko, Stojan i Mirsad; sada su podržani bosanski i slovenski\n"
"- Naglasak riječi i prirodna rečenična melodija za svaki glas; Josip i Vlado imaju novi mehanizam bez pucketanja, s prirodnim tempom, a brzina i visina više ne utječu jedna na drugu\n"
"- Deset pjevajućih glasova: Orguljaš, Dalmacija Klapa, Trubač, Harmonikaš, Sevdalija, Sazlija, Lika Velebit, Solunac, Sarajevo Bembaša i Bećarac\n"
"- NVDA-ov klizač Intonacija upravlja rečeničnom melodijom svakog glasa, a naglasni rječnik (accents.json) ispravlja naglasak riječi\n"
"- Slova se slovkaju glasovima (b, c, d), osim ako je u Konfiguratoru odabrano slovkanje nazivima; velika se slova slovkaju uz NVDA-ovu promjenu visine za velika slova, kao kod NVDA-ovih drugih govornih jedinica\n"
"- Dodatak i Laprdus konfigurator dostupni su na engleskom, hrvatskom, srpskom i slovenskom jeziku: oba prate jezik NVDA-a\n"
"- Ispravljeno: korisnički unosi u rječnicima za slovkanje i emodžije nisu imali učinka\n"

